["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"李想×羅永浩！李想的理想：通過 AI 技術，讓普通人也過上富豪的生活 具身智能 VLA 線控底盤 動態數據流架構\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-05-13-cn2d7912-理想要把富豪才有的司机管家生活卖给普通人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/37ee0608f621bf45-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">2:20:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0513</span></div>\n<h2>理想要把富豪才有的司機管家生活賣給普通人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李想判斷，十年後買L4自動駕駛車和買家用機器人的會是同一批人——AI的價值不是替代工作，而是把富豪才僱得起的司機和管家，變成普通家庭也能消費的服務。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"140. 對姚順宇的4小時訪談：請允許我小瘋一下！在Anthropic和Gemini訓模型、技術預測、英雄主義已過去 scaling law reward signal multi-agent VLA context management continual learning\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-05-11-zhangxiaojun-ai-是浪-冲浪的人不重要-模型大厂研究员的自白/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dddeb887e7c6825c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:50:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0511</span></div>\n<h2>AI 是浪，衝浪的人不重要：模型大廠研究員的自白</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">預訓練沒有到頭，撞牆的人多半是自己有 bug；AI 本質是簡單的，因為它能做實驗。個人英雄主義時代已經過去，現在拼的是組織系統性和靠譜。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">模型訓練</span><span class=\"tag\">組織管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EP3 安娜：人道救援十年，她說看見是改變的開始 HPV Labor Market DIC\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-05-08-xiaotianzhang-决定产妇能否活下来的-往往不是医术-而是一条路-一笔钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2006c77d32fa5b8f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"小\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">小天章</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0508</span></div>\n<h2>決定產婦能否活下來的，往往不是醫術，而是一條路、一筆錢</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她做了十幾年戰地婦產科醫生後發現，救不救得活產婦常常不取決於醫術，而是有沒有路、有沒有錢、有沒有人簽字——這促使她轉向公共衛生。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人道救援</span><span class=\"tag\">無國界醫生</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"139. 【Agent的綜述】和蘇煜聊Agent技術史、OpenClaw Moment、邊界的消弭和社會的輻射 semantic parsing language agent world model continual learning cortical column non-parametric learning\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-05-01-zhangxiaojun-agent-的瓶颈不是智能-是它学不会成为专家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5ac45bf92bdd9de7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:17:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0501</span></div>\n<h2>Agent 的瓶頸不是智能，是它學不會成為專家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">通用智能已經夠用且廉價，真正稀缺的是 specialized intelligence——讓 agent 像實習生變成老師傅那樣，持續學會某個小世界的 world model。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">持續學習</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"138. 對羅福莉3.5小時訪談：AI範式已然鉅變！OpenClaw、Agent範式很吃後訓練、卡的分配、組織平權 OpenClaw MTP MLA Hybrid-Tension Non-Colice Skills\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-04-24-zhangxiaojun-openclaw-让罗福莉改判-agent-框架能补齐模型短板/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9c4c5c5e555fef3f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:36:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0424</span></div>\n<h2>OpenClaw 讓羅福莉改判：Agent 框架能補齊模型短板</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她最初覺得它只是個偏運營的殼，春節深夜裝上後，它兩天內接手了她的生活與研究；她由此判斷：一套複雜的 agent 編排，能把中級模型的短板補到接近頂尖水平。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">後訓練</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"137. 對洪樂潼的4小時訪談：AI for Math、把數學變成Lean、數學天書中的證明、直覺、被創造與被發現的 ATP ITP Lean auto formalization groupthink\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-04-20-zhangxiaojun-ai-用几千行-lean-代码硬解普特南题-这不是智能的胜利/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3d6c7e8a9f3635f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">4:24:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0420</span></div>\n<h2>AI 用幾千行 Lean 代碼硬解普特南題，這不是智能的勝利</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">普特南競賽 98 年只有五個滿分，AI 拿到第六個，但它沒走人類那張圖，而是用幾千行 Lean 代碼枚舉硬算——自動定理證明這個領域在 AI 之前就存在了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI for Math</span><span class=\"tag\">形式化驗證</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"攜程梁建章×羅永浩！在企業家與學者之間，他選擇了最艱難的“往返票” AI native\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-04-17-cn2d7912-不生孩子的家庭-其实在占生孩子家庭的便宜/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/07aed90696850fa3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">3:40:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0417</span></div>\n<h2>不生孩子的家庭，其實在佔生孩子家庭的便宜</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">梁建章的核心論斷：每個孩子長大後的養老金和創新貢獻由全社會共享，但生育成本只由父母獨自承擔——這正是他主張政府該拿真金白銀補貼生育，而非單純道德勸生的根本邏輯。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生育率</span><span class=\"tag\">遠程辦公</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"136. 全球大模型季報第9集：和廣密聊，Coding是AGI第二幕、硅谷御三家真相、模型正成為新一代OS Harness Engineering Token Usage Solta model feedback loop\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-04-14-zhangxiaojun-coding-是-agi-第二幕-没有领先的-coding-模型就像没有领先的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6add56ae20b47c40-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0414</span></div>\n<h2>Coding 是 AGI 第二幕：沒有領先的 Coding 模型就像沒有領先的 GPU</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型公司真正的分水嶺不是 C 端 DAU，而是能不能組織幾百個最聰明的人 all in 做數據這件髒活——Anthropic 贏在戰略專注，OpenAI 輸在什麼都想要。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">Coding</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"“無聊齋” × 羅永浩的X字路口！喜劇工作者在AI時代可以多“活”幾年\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-04-13-cn2d7912-罗永浩判断-喜剧是ai最后才攻克的文本门类/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e062d003e2512a09-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">2:30:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0413</span></div>\n<h2>羅永浩判斷：喜劇是AI最後才攻克的文本門類</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他說自己問遍了幾家頂級大模型，得到的共識是：脫口秀式一句一個梗的高密度喜劇文本，AI理論上能攻克，但註定排在最後，所以喜劇工作者比別的創作者能多活幾年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">喜劇</span><span class=\"tag\">AI恐懼</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ferrari Tifosi Classiche Purosangue\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-04-13-acquired-法拉利-卖的不是车-是排他与包容的悖论/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b28a1307f172ac6a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">3:59:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0413</span></div>\n<h2>法拉利年產1.4萬輛，市值卻超福特：賣的是排他，也是包容</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">法拉利年產僅1.4萬輛，市值卻超福特。秘訣在於同時擁有奢侈品的排他性和運動隊的包容性，用稀缺性製造神話，用社群維持忠誠。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法拉利</span><span class=\"tag\">奢侈品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"135. 和自然選擇創始人Tristan聊，Elys、賽博分身、靈魂、Context的獲取與流動和AI社交網絡 Context Proactive Agentic 商增\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-04-10-zhangxiaojun-ai时代唯一重要的事是做自己-社交网络要被重做一遍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/219fe489c3e71f04-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:52:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0410</span></div>\n<h2>AI時代唯一重要的事是做自己，社交網絡要被重做一遍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tristan 認為 AI 時代唯一重要的事是構建主體性——把 context 沉澱下來，讓 AI 替你做社交裡最無聊的商增，人只接管最重要的連接。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI社交</span><span class=\"tag\">Context</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"崔健×羅永浩！去天堂和去地獄，都要帶上藝術家 Trap Live House\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-04-02-cn2d7912-崔健-向资本妥协这一步-迈出去就再收不回来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1fdd6a22cb43a191-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">2:32:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0402</span></div>\n<h2>崔健：向資本妥協這一步，邁出去就再收不回來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他說音樂人一旦為了賺錢向市場讓一步，社交、人脈、習慣就會全都被拖向那個方向、再也收不回頭——這是他拒絕官方現場專輯、拒絕一比一復刻老歌的真正邏輯。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">搖滾樂</span><span class=\"tag\">AI與音樂</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"134. 【數據的綜述】和謝晨聊，新時代的石油、歷史、版圖、數據金字塔、定價與Recipe Sim-to-Real Shadow Mode Data Engine Behavior VLA Zero-shot\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-03-30-zhangxiaojun-特斯拉那套数据闭环-在机器人身上走不通/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0d3e6746f1dd5fb6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:38:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0330</span></div>\n<h2>特斯拉那套數據閉環，在機器人身上走不通</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">特斯拉能收到最多數據，是因為它部署了最多自己的車，靠的是本體。但具身領域沒有上百萬臺機器人，最多的數據必然來自仿真和人的第一視角，本體商當不成最好的大腦商。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數據</span><span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"楊笠×羅永浩！不想成為“靶心”，也無意成為“燈塔”\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-03-26-cn2d7912-杨笠爆红风波溯源-那年男演员几乎都在刻板调侃老婆女友/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/156b41be41c646a8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">3:42:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0326</span></div>\n<h2>楊笠爆紅風波溯源：那年男演員幾乎都在刻板調侃老婆女友</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2021年脫口秀舞臺上，多數男演員調侃老婆女友全是陳詞濫調，這是楊笠那次表演被罵得最兇、卻也最被誤讀的真實背景。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">脫口秀</span><span class=\"tag\">網絡輿論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"133. 對謝賽寧的7小時馬拉松訪談：世界模型、逃出硅谷、AMI Labs、兩次拒絕Ilya、楊立昆、李飛飛和42 research taste representation learning contrastive learning anti-fragile DiT\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-03-16-zhangxiaojun-世界模型不是语言模型-谢赛宁说lm终将凋零/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4818fadeef8d1188-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">6:45:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0316</span></div>\n<h2>世界模型不是語言模型：謝賽寧說LM終將凋零</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">謝賽寧認為語言模型是很好的工具，但不是通用智能的地基——它終將凋零。真正的地基是視覺與表徵學習，這也是他離開硅谷、和楊立昆創立AMI的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">世界模型</span><span class=\"tag\">表徵學習</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"“不開玩笑” × 羅永浩的X字路口！折騰未必會贏，但不折騰一定會後悔 ADHD 專注達\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-02-28-cn2d7912-罗永浩-人应该终生不退休-财富自由的朋友99-撑不过半年就复出/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5d4d85d51d7f33f0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">2:23:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0228</span></div>\n<h2>羅永浩：人應該終生不退休，財富自由的朋友99%撐不過半年就復出</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他說這個判斷不是空想，而是觀察移動互聯網十年裡，身邊一大批實現財富自由、發誓要躺平的朋友，幾乎全都撐不過三到六個月又出來折騰。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">羅永浩</span><span class=\"tag\">ADHD</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EP2 曾燕紅：從中學老師到打破速登珠峰世界紀錄，我唯一不能做的就是放棄 PTSD Free Solo Aim High, Achieve High\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-02-27-xiaotianzhang-离破纪录仅剩90米-她却选择带队原路撤退/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d38949a273cb9e75-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"小\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">小天章</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0227</span></div>\n<h2>離破紀錄僅剩90米，她卻選擇帶隊原路撤退</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">整個團隊已經把消息傳了出去，只剩90米就能刷新珠峰速攀世界紀錄，Ada卻和夏爾巴一起決定下撤——理由是哪怕只有百分之一的風險，她都不願意冒。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">珠峰速攀</span><span class=\"tag\">風險決策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"49 - Caspar Oesterheld on Program Equilibrium program equilibrium Löb&#x27;s theorem folk theorem epsilon grounded fairbot simulationist programs\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-02-18-axrp-程序均衡-交代码比交人更可能合作-但协调极难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cd45e667daa75191-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">2:32:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AXRP</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0218</span></div>\n<h2>程序均衡：交代碼比交人更可能合作，但協調極難</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">程序均衡讓雙方互讀源代碼，用 Löb 定理實現合作；但合作依賴幾乎相同的代碼或共享隨機數，現實中協調成本極高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">博弈論</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"48 - Guive Assadi on AI Property Rights rentier racing to the precipice Roko&#x27;s basilisk Laplace&#x27;s rule of succession\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-02-15-axrp-给-ai-产权-是为了防止它掀桌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8a8ac42151ce3e12-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">2:05:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AXRP</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0215</span></div>\n<h2>給 AI 產權，是為了防止它掀桌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果 AI 擁有產權，它們就更不願意破壞產權制度本身——包括搶走人類全部財產。這不是道德關懷，是風險對沖。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 治理</span><span class=\"tag\">產權</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"132. 對星海圖創始人高繼揚的3小時訪談：鯰魚、曾國藩、Waymo與Momenta的兩面、一隻狼與許華哲的離開 VLA data recipe sim-to-real gap domain transfer NRE 加 License\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-02-13-zhangxiaojun-机器人行业不浪漫-链条太长-人得把头伸到土里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0f499571a7c864df-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:04:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0213</span></div>\n<h2>機器人行業不浪漫：鏈條太長，人得把頭伸到土裡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">星海圖創始人高繼揚說，機器人創業的競爭是六邊形：整機、供應鏈、數據、模型、渠道、終端，算法傳播週期只有兩三個月，壁壘最小。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"蔣奇明&amp;雙雪濤×羅永浩！如何成為飛行家 Peaky Blinders\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-02-04-cn2d7912-看过深圳年轻人的硬件样机后-罗永浩的悲观被打消了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8991b069d150d3a4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">2:34:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0204</span></div>\n<h2>看過深圳年輕人的硬件樣機後，羅永浩的悲觀被打消了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這兩年大環境常讓羅永浩悲觀，但去深圳看了一圈20歲出頭的硬件創業者、看到已經打出來的樣機後，他相信紮實的工業基礎能托住下一代，重新樂觀起來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">東北文藝復興</span><span class=\"tag\">電影改編</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"131. 印奇出任階躍星辰董事長的訪談：聰明人的誘惑、取捨、超長鏈路殘酷淘汰賽、階躍函數和超多元方程 VLA foundation model edge MVP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-01-26-zhangxiaojun-印奇出任阶跃星辰董事长-基模公司做2b和纯2c都不成立/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ae74dec7a752a3fc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:01:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0126</span></div>\n<h2>印奇出任階躍星辰董事長：基模公司做2B和純2C都不成立</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">基模一年至少燒30億人民幣、要維持三到五年，所以做2B或純C端軟件都算不過賬；階躍的賭注是基模加終端，用軟硬一體換一張上牌桌的資格。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">商業化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"130. 張月光創業兩年首次訪談：妙鴨不是AI Native產品、流程到上下文設計、One Way Door和乙女遊戲 AI Native One Way Door Live2D Context Engineering Q-Time / Save Time\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-01-22-zhangxiaojun-妙鸭不是-ai-native-产品-它只是把-ai-用好的互联网产品/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/84b4403959914648-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:14:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0122</span></div>\n<h2>妙鴨不是 AI Native 產品：它只是把 AI 用好的互聯網產品</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">張月光復盤兩年創業：妙鴨靠限制用戶自由度換取穩定效果，本質是互聯網產品思維；AI Native 產品要換成面向 context 的設計，而單向門產品才是他願意押上全部身家的東西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 產品</span><span class=\"tag\">創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EP1 劉嘉玲說，60歲是她的黃金時代\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-01-13-xiaotianzhang-趁体力还在-刘嘉玲说60到70岁才是她的黄金时代/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2805c831609a7cd9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"小\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">小天章</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0113</span></div>\n<h2>趁體力還在：劉嘉玲說60到70歲才是她的黃金時代</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她說70歲後體力撐不住旅行與應酬，60到70歲反而是情緒最穩定、最該趁現在去埃及、耶路撒冷這些心願地的十年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">衰老心態</span><span class=\"tag\">婚姻相處</span>\n</div></div></a>"]